back your son, along with the money.

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:00.360
No.

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:05.730
My son's safety is what's most
important. Let her have the money.

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:07.530
But that would be unfair to you...

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:11.430
I'm the one who hired you!
Don't do anything that I didn't ask for!

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:12.570
Y-Yes...

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:17.000
I just want my son returned to me safely.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.810
Are you sure you're not regretting it?

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:24.080
Of course not!
Are you sure you're not regretting it?

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:25.110
Of course not!

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:29.250
I've decided that I'm going to be
with you forever, no matter what.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:31.120
I'm actually regretting it a bit.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:34.820
I know all too well how your father feels.

00:06:34.820 --> 00:06:35.920
After all, I'm...

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:37.830
Stop it, Joanca!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.820
You promised not to
talk about that anymore!

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:41.500
Yes...

