One, two!
One, two!

00:06:58.550 --> 00:07:00.480
Hamburgers, yours and mine!
Hamburgers, yours and mine!

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.380
Hamburgers, anytime, anywhere!
Hamburgers, anytime, anywhere!

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:04.150
Hamburgers are part of our relationship!
Hamburgers are part of our relationship!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.350
So let's go get some hamburgers!
So let's go get some hamburgers!

