this is a lame job, don't you think?

00:07:58.640 --> 00:08:01.680
All we have to do is hand over
the money and bring him back.

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:04.450
On top of that, that kid
is gross, gross and gross.

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:07.210
