Hey, don't you think so?

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:12.820
Huh? What?

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:15.120
"I'll get wrinkles if I talk
with a face mask on"?

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:16.490
Hah!

00:08:16.490 --> 00:08:18.550
That's because you have skin like a hag!

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.830
Hi, it's me. How have you been?

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:33.770
Crap. I know I've seen her somewhere
