00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:02.960
Wow, look at how beautiful it is.

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:04.860
I'm glad we decided to come.

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:05.930
Yes.

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:07.640
