00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:42.530
Hurry up and hand over the boy.

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:44.470
D-Don't listen to them, Clicky!

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:46.460
I have no idea what they're talking about.

00:11:48.440 --> 00:11:51.600
I know. I would never doubt you.

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:55.110
Stop making such crazy accusations!

00:11:55.110 --> 00:11:58.150
Doing some last-minute math, huh?

00:11:58.150 --> 00:12:00.610
