00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:27.500
Be quiet!

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:31.170
Now that I have this money,
I don't need you anymore, Clicky.

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:34.780
Did you really think that I loved you?

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:37.580
