00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.820
A Lanz Ray Emanation System!

00:13:47.820 --> 00:13:47.990
Lanz Ray?
A Lanz Ray Emanation System!

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:48.690
Lanz Ray?

