00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:09.400
That's right. What you saw
was an animated photo of Joanca.

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:11.480
How could you, Papa?!

00:14:11.480 --> 00:14:13.980
I did it all for you, Clicky.

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:18.520
Hmph! So that woman's more than just
