00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:48.250
Huh?

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:50.780
A man?!
A man?!

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:52.850
That's enough, Papa!

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:56.520
I don't care about her past! Joanca is
